Note on third-party assets:

- `NST_Code/vgg_normalised.pth` contains VGG-19 weights in the "normalised" form
  distributed with the original AdaIN implementation by Xun Huang
  (https://github.com/xunhuang1995/AdaIN-style). They are used here unmodified
  as a frozen feature extractor.
- Sample content and style images under `NST_Code/examples/`, `content_data/` and
  `style_data/` are used for demonstration only and remain the property of their
  respective owners.
